{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_03",
  "title": "安全屋攻防战",
  "storyCode": "OD-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7c040ec515ac69310b2f759bd130a2f7ee5bd5ba0606f2c1c0ea586fe2c3043",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铳？雇佣兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么瞎话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说的全是真的，老大！他们拿着大型铳，贾曼被他们干掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿着大型铳的雇佣兵？萨科塔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想告诉我，你们任务失败，是因为四个萨科塔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们应该不是萨科塔人......大概？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是萨科塔人但是拿着大型铳的佣兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你要撒谎，你可以把故事杜撰得真实一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说的是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说的是真的，那几个武装人员确实不是萨科塔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "贾曼被打烂了脑袋，但是我没看到箭矢与弩弹，萨卡兹人可没有那么脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些人不在你的计划范围内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前合同里可没提到我们还得对付一群全副武装拿着铳器的佣兵，老板，得加钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些佣兵现在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不在感染者社区了，我们的人在排查，没见到太大动静，应该还没离开镇子周边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老混蛋那边的状况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你父亲的手下都很厉害，尤其是你的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们干掉了几个卫兵，但没能突破宅邸的防线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那科学家的怪物干得不错，但是你找来的术师们就是废物，很多怪物折损得毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们已经是我能雇到的术师里最靠谱的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非你们的老板愿意指派术师过来，不然抱怨也没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就让你的科学家多造点怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者换个战术，强行攻打大宅行不通。你家的大宅就是个要塞，你妹妹也不是省油的灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老混蛋呢？他还是躲在屋子里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我根本就没看到你的父亲，自始至终他都没有露面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈......我就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道他出事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续盯着大宅，有情况立刻告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于我刚才提到的“换个战术”的部分，你的动作得快一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是萨卡兹佣兵的直觉。事情拖得越久，破绽就越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确实有备用计划，不过我需要时间来安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lab"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我对自己的实验成果非常自信，但是从表情来看，你似乎没有类似的体验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，说说看，又是哪个环节出岔子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要加快一点进度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了毫无意义的催促，你还能讲点更有建设性的意见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我带给你的尸体够多了，我还需要至少二十只这种怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畸变体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“这种怪物”叫源石畸变体，它是有名字的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突变体、畸变体，我才不在乎这东西叫什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要更多的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前已经给你不少了，这么快就死光了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很好奇......你的手下是怎么操纵畸变体的？依靠你们的“源石技艺”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这算是什么？超能力？神秘学？法术？原理是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，满足我的好奇心，我想和你手下的那些“术师”聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干好你的本职工作，学者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技艺不是你现在需要操心的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等事成之后，你有的是时间做你的研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄语）我对你的事业还真没什么信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过说到时间，我有没有提醒过你？其实你的时间也不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些源石畸变体的寿命不会超过一周，无论你想要做什么，动作都得快一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又在搞什么鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是代价，是你毫无耐心的代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要高速制造这些畸变体，又想要它们孔武有力，你还希望它们没有任何缺点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当真觉得天底下有这样的好事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说过，不要和我耍花招，学者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很忙，没时间和你开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你这么不满意，我建议你自己来，动用你的聪明才智，搞定我这个专业人士短时间无法解决的基因工程问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，你也可以给我带来更多的材料，给我更多的时间，来为你无趣的“家庭伦理剧”添砖加瓦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科学是公平的，你总是有得选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要和我油嘴滑舌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续你的工作，学者。如果你失败了，我不会饶了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失败的代价就是惨死，很惨。我说到做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你把话说成这样，那我还能怎么接呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝你好运，我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浓烟四起，满地狼藉，不用靠近就能掌握大致状况了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到是这种规模的本地骚乱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "贸然介入一定会出问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一片混乱，镇子北边的大宅附近一直有人在打斗，其中一方像是雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他地方更糟，四下都是血迹和半塌的房屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......感染的沙地兽在巷子里窜行，数量不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "局势已经这样了，萨尔贡的官方武装力量呢？王酋的军队呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "北边的大宅里有一些装备统一的卫兵，但是没看到其他萨尔贡士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这种程度的骚乱持续了两天，那安全屋的那位干员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凶多吉少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不要下结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......另一个消息是，我找到安全屋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人驻守在安全屋那边，但不是罗德岛的人员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安全屋已经被雇佣兵占领了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不一样，不太像是普通的雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的防御阵地非常专业，伏击火力点、陷阱、诱饵一应俱全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的是，安全屋里有很多镇民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇民？驻守阵地的是什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来像是你们的同行，他们有铳器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铳器？黑钢的佣兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们身上没有明显的标志，不一定是黑钢佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抹去了身份标识的专业武装人员......还带着铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......头疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇子里有很多不同的势力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以排除是匪帮劫掠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没看到王酋的军队，也不像是战争行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里的情况远比老夫预想的......要复杂很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愿意在骚乱中保护镇民的人应该不是什么穷凶极恶的歹徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定可以尝试交涉一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谨慎一点，即便只从他们保护镇民的行为来判断，也有很多不同的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫只期望对方是可以沟通的那种人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，完全搞不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西，看起来像是电路板，但是和我了解的电路差太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果给我一个月时间，外带一本技术手册，我说不定能研究明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我还是去楼上站岗吧，蹲得我腰都酸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦了，Lord。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没搞定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个通讯器的内部结构全都是我们没接触过的技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得可以放弃维修了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从外观上完全看不出来，感觉就只是一台发报机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和之前那辆厢型车一样，这个世界的能源基础很特殊，所有技术的基础全部都来自这种叫源石的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们还在研究那台通讯器啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石通讯设备使用了很复杂的技术，以往都是需要罗德岛外派工程术师来维护的，修不好很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前说用这台机器联系到了救援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......我不确定是不是真的联系到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些暴徒攻击安全屋的时候，我手忙脚乱地启动了通讯器，但是还没来得及说几句就被他们闯进来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时情况太紧急了，我也口齿不清的......说不定收到求援的罗德岛干员根本就没听清我说了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以没有援军了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一开始我就没期待过援军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们看起来一点都不紧张。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如说，没有支援的作战，我们已经习惯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，现在想想，你们当时再来晚一点啊，我这下半辈子就得在轮椅上度过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有可能直接躺在棺材里，连轮椅都不需要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是得谢谢你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用客气，你也帮了那些镇民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，也不能这么说，毕竟救治感染者也是罗德岛的本业嘛，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......虽然我只是个看门的后勤预备干员就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救治......所以这里才准备了医疗物资？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是这些武器是做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这个嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然罗德岛的本业是制药，但是安全屋其实并不提供医疗救助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安全屋主要负责为外勤战斗人员提供物资补给，备用武器什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等？这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是榴弹发射器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "榴弹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好家伙，这个是地雷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "种类还挺多啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我一开始还以为这里的人都不使用热兵器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个榴弹发射器的结构有点奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有发射药的榴弹，难道要靠压缩气体打出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看这个，还有用液压弹簧的型号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！那箱子里面是源石爆炸物，很危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥克芬先生，这里有枪械弹药吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "枪械......你是说铳器？啊，你在问蚀刻弹药？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那种昂贵的东西，安全屋一般不会准备，罗德岛的战斗人员里很少有人用铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些爆炸物，我们能用吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们得小心点，源石爆炸物都很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放在以往，这些东西只有专职战斗的干员才能调用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过你们看起来都是个中好手，我也不好说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些呢？这些稀奇古怪的零件是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些是施术单元备用装置，小心别弄坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "施术单元......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是那个叫“源石技艺”的东西吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技艺，就是那些丢火球的技术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个讲起来就复杂了，我也不是术师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且源石技艺的种类五花八门，术师们擅长的方向都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那刚才提到的工程术师也是其中一种？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？你们以前没接触过源石技艺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个嘛......我们见识得比较少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这怎么可能呢？你们都拿着铳，你们不是术师吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会使用源石技艺的铳械使用者？嘿，这可稀奇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，奥克芬先生，你的脚还没有好，不建议你下地走路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事没事，有拐杖，勉强能走两步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，下面的病人们怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分人的伤势都稳定下来了，多亏这里的医疗设备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的脸色很不好，没问题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一晚上没睡，没有关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要多休息，如果我们中唯一的医生累倒了，就本末倒置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，我会注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来源石技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有没有那种，念一段咒语，然后一阵闪光之后病就好了的法术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么啊，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有吗？那喝下去就能愈合伤口的治疗药水呢？也没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那种东西只有科幻小说里才有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能够治愈伤痛的源石技艺确实存在，不过这一类源石技艺都是极难掌握的类型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要掌握这种源石技艺，施术者首先需要掌握全面的医学知识，了解不同种族的身体结构等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，大部分医疗源石技艺的使用者也只能做到止血或是加速伤口愈合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这类源石技艺在手术台上非常重要，但在我的经验里，它们不能替代真正的医治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，你会使用源石技艺吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "略懂一点......虽然没什么大用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这也太现实了......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有魔法的世界也这么不方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等，你刚才说了科幻小说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还真有点好奇你们世界的科幻小说是什么样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在大一点的城市能找到书店吗？历史书籍呢？卖得贵吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确实越来越感兴趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们几个还真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们是从哪儿来的？哥伦比亚？维多利亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们说话的口音听起来像是好几十年前的维多利亚人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个......我还真不知道怎么回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科恩小姐他们来自一个很遥远的地方，那里甚至连矿石病都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有矿石病的国度，真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有矿石病，没有感染者，那岂不是也没有对感染者的歧视，大地上所有人都是平等的，多少仇恨打一开始就不存在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的妈啊，那得是什么样的好地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥克芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，看你们表情也知道了，就当我没问吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌袭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseoutdoorD"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告情况！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只是第一波，他们围上来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前只是试探性的进攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更多人正在靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陷阱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意补充一下爆炸物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闪击，注意左翼，不要让他们绕过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lord，节约弹药！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，让他们来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼观四路，谨防偷袭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看他们有什么本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先别开枪......等他们再靠近一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九点钟方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lord，正前方，敌人又站起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些长角的大个子不好对付，瞄准头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰烬！看那边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lord！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*俄语粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚历山大！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先别管我！坚守防线！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是什么鬼东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意那些畸形的人形生物！不要躲在轻掩体后面！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_deserttownD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "专业的阵地构建，这四个人可不是等闲之辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铳器的声音......不......这种激烈的爆响，是速射型号的大型铳器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们被包围了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "袭击者和攻击大宅的佣兵是同一拨人，不会错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这些怪物，让我想起在龙门的经历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“宿主”和“牧群”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是不太一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手持大型铳器的佣兵和驱使神秘怪物战斗的佣兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "局势在变化，平衡马上就要被打破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毋需犹豫，准备作战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "操纵这种怪物作战的人绝非善类，不需要对他们手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
